/ Player dashboard: servers the user pinned for one-click access to their hub.
/ Cards are single-click nav, like the community cards below; the
/ favorite/unfavorite toggle lives on the destination (the hub sidebar), not here.
/ locals: favorite_servers
.mb-5
  .d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-between.mb-2
    h3.mb-0
      i.bi.bi-star-fill.text-warning.me-2
      | Favorite Servers
    = link_to discover_path, class: "btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary"
      i.bi.bi-plus-lg.me-1
      | Add server

  p.text-muted.small.mb-4
    | Jump straight into the servers you play.

  - if favorite_servers.any?
    .row.g-3
      - favorite_servers.each do |server|
        .col-12
          = link_to server_path(server.public_id), class: "text-decoration-none d-block"
            .card.bg-dark.border-secondary.community-nav-card
              .card-body.d-flex.align-items-center.py-3
                / Server icon
                .me-3.flex-shrink-0
                  - if server.connected?
                    .bg-success.bg-opacity-25.rounded.d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center style="width: 48px; height: 48px;"
                      i.bi.bi-hdd-network.text-success.fs-4
                  - else
                    .bg-secondary.bg-opacity-25.rounded.d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center style="width: 48px; height: 48px;"
                      i.bi.bi-hdd-network.text-secondary.fs-4

                / Server info
                .flex-grow-1.min-w-0
                  h5.mb-1.text-light.text-truncate = server.server_name
                  .text-muted.font-monospace.small.mb-2 = "#{server.server_id} · #{server.community.community_name}"
                  .d-flex.align-items-center
                    - if server.connected?
                      .server-status.server-status--online.me-1
                      small.text-muted Online
                    - else
                      .server-status.server-status--offline.me-1
                      small.text-muted Offline

                / Arrow indicator
                .ms-3.flex-shrink-0
                  i.bi.bi-chevron-right.text-muted

  - else
    .card.bg-dark.border-secondary
      .card-body.text-center.py-4
        i.bi.bi-star.text-muted.fs-3.d-block.mb-2
        p.text-muted.mb-0 No favorite servers yet. Click "Add server" above to find one on Discover.
